🏛️ Parks and Recreation SQL Analysis Project
📊 Project Overview
This project is a structured SQL analysis of a fictional Parks and Recreation employee database, commonly used for learning data analysis and SQL fundamentals.
The objective is to simulate a real-world HR analytics environment by analyzing employee demographics, salaries, and departmental structures using SQL.
This project demonstrates the ability to:
* Query relational databases
* Analyze employee and salary data
* Identify business insights
* Use SQL for reporting and decision-making
